{"affected":[{"defaultStatus":"unknown","original_ranges":[{"status":"affected","version":"25.5.19.439"}],"product":"Total Security","vendor":"G DATA"}],"aliases":["CVE-2026-19777"],"assertions":[{"affected_indices":[0],"datePublic":"2026-11-18T15:38:55.985Z","descriptions":[{"lang":"en","value":"G DATA Total Security AVKProxy Link Following Denial-of-Service Vulnerability. This vulnerability allows local attackers to create a denial-of-service condition on affected installations of G DATA Total Security. An attacker must first obtain the ability to execute low-privileged code on the target system in order to exploit this vulnerability.\n\nThe specific flaw exists within the G DATA ANTIVIRUS Proxy Service. By creating a symbolic link, an attacker can abuse the service to create a file. An attacker can leverage this vulnerability to create a persistent denial-of-service condition on the system. Was ZDI-CAN-28662."}],"metrics":[{"cvssV3_0":{"baseScore":6.1,"baseSeverity":"MEDIUM","vectorString":"CVSS:3.0/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:H","version":"3.0"},"format":"CVSS"}],"problemTypes":[{"descriptions":[{"cweId":"CWE-59","description":"CWE-59: Improper Link Resolution Before File Access ('Link Following')","lang":"en","type":"CWE"}]}],"provider":{"dateUpdated":"2026-11-20T19:42:14.505Z","orgId":"99f1926a-a320-47d8-bbb5-42feb611262e","shortName":"zdi"},"role":"cna","title":"G DATA Total Security AVKProxy Link Following Denial-of-Service Vulnerability"},{"affected_indices":[],"metrics":[{"other":{"content":{"id":"CVE-2026-19777","options":[{"Exploitation":"none"},{"Automatable":"no"},{"Technical Impact":"partial"}],"role":"CISA Coordinator","timestamp":"2026-11-20T21:07:44.584648Z","version":"2.0.3"},"type":"ssvc"}}],"provider":{"dateUpdated":"2026-11-20T21:08:06.131Z","orgId":"134c704f-9b21-4f2e-91b3-4a467353bcc0","shortName":"CISA-ADP"},"role":"adp","title":"CISA ADP Vulnrichment"}],"assessment":{"authentication":null,"classifier_version":"1.0","confidence":"unkno